export const adapters = {tencent:'腾讯官网公开招聘',greenhouse:'Greenhouse API',lever:'Lever API',remotive:'Remotive 免费远程 API',rss:'RSS / Atom',jsonld:'JSON-LD 职位页',codex:'Codex 浏览器检索'};
export const viewLabels = {home:'首页',discover:'岗位发现',sources:'招聘来源',settings:'检索配置',runs:'运行记录'};
export function resolveView(hash, current='home'){if(hash==='#main')return Object.hasOwn(viewLabels,current)?current:'home';const view=hash.replace(/^#/,'');return Object.hasOwn(viewLabels,view)?view:'home';}
export const numeric = {max_age_days:['最大发布天数',1,3650],stale_after_days:['复核期限（天）',1,365],max_results:['每来源结果上限',1,1000],timeout_seconds:['请求超时（秒）',1,120],request_delay_seconds:['请求间隔（秒）',0,60],retries:['失败重试次数',0,5],max_pages:['最多检索页数',1,20],min_interval_hours:['最低抓取间隔（小时）',0,168]};
const searchKeys=['keywords','exclude_keywords','locations'];
const defaultKeys=['keyword_mode','search_fields',...Object.keys(numeric)];
export function splitList(value){return value.split(/[,，\n]/).map(s=>s.trim()).filter(Boolean);}
export function safeLink(value){try{const u=new URL(value);const host=u.hostname.toLowerCase().replace(/\.$/,'');if(!['https:','http:'].includes(u.protocol)||u.username||u.password||/[\s\\\x00-\x1f]/.test(value)||host==='localhost'||host.endsWith('.local')||host.endsWith('.internal')||host.endsWith('.localhost')||!host.includes('.')||/^(127\.|10\.|192\.168\.|169\.254\.|0\.|172\.(1[6-9]|2\d|3[01])\.)/.test(host)||(u.port&&!['80','443'].includes(u.port)))return null;return u.href;}catch{return null;}}
export function validateConfig(config){
 const fail=m=>{throw new Error(m)};
 const object=v=>v&&typeof v==='object'&&!Array.isArray(v);
 const list=(v,k)=>{if(!Array.isArray(v)||v.some(x=>typeof x!=='string'||!x.trim()))fail(`${k} 需要字符串数组`)};
 const exact=(v,keys,label)=>{if(!object(v)||Object.keys(v).length!==keys.length||Object.keys(v).some(k=>!keys.includes(k)))fail(`${label} 字段不完整或含未知字段`)};
 const rules=(v,label)=>{if(!object(v)||Object.keys(v).some(k=>![...searchKeys,...defaultKeys].includes(k)))fail(`${label} 含未知策略字段`);for(const k of searchKeys)if(k in v)list(v[k],k);if('keyword_mode'in v&&!['any','all'].includes(v.keyword_mode))fail('匹配方式必须为 any / all');if('search_fields'in v){list(v.search_fields,'search_fields');if(!v.search_fields.length||v.search_fields.some(k=>!['title','company','location','tags','description'].includes(k)))fail('检索字段无效');}for(const[k,[label,min,max]]of Object.entries(numeric))if(k in v&&(typeof v[k]!=='number'||!Number.isFinite(v[k])||v[k]<min||v[k]>max||(k!=='request_delay_seconds'&&!Number.isInteger(v[k]))))fail(`${label} 应在 ${min}–${max} 之间${k!=='request_delay_seconds'?'，且为整数':''}`);};
 exact(config,['schema_version','project','search','defaults','sources'],'配置');if(config.schema_version!==1)fail('schema_version 必须为 1');exact(config.project,['name','description'],'project');if(typeof config.project.name!=='string'||!config.project.name.trim()||typeof config.project.description!=='string')fail('项目名称或描述无效');exact(config.search,searchKeys,'search');if(!object(config.defaults)||defaultKeys.filter(k=>k!=='min_interval_hours').some(k=>!(k in config.defaults))||Object.keys(config.defaults).some(k=>!defaultKeys.includes(k)))fail('defaults 字段不完整或含未知字段');rules(config.search,'search');rules(config.defaults,'defaults');if(!Array.isArray(config.sources))fail('sources 必须为数组');const ids=new Set();
 for(const s of config.sources){if(!object(s)||Object.keys(s).some(k=>!['id','name','adapter','enabled','board','company','region','url','urls','query_template','strategy','notes'].includes(k)))fail('来源含未知字段，请勿填写密钥');if(typeof s.id!=='string'||!/^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{0,63}$/.test(s.id)||ids.has(s.id))fail('来源 ID 应唯一，仅用小写字母、数字及连字符');ids.add(s.id);if(!s.name||typeof s.name!=='string'||typeof s.enabled!=='boolean'||!Object.hasOwn(adapters,s.adapter))fail('来源名称、启用状态或检索方式无效');rules(s.strategy??{},s.name);for(const k of ['company','notes','query_template'])if(k in s&&typeof s[k]!=='string')fail(`${k} 必须为字符串`);if(['greenhouse','lever'].includes(s.adapter)&&(!s.board||!/^[\w-]+$/.test(s.board)))fail('请填写有效的 board 标识');if('region'in s&&!['global','eu'].includes(s.region))fail('region 需要 global 或 eu');if('url'in s&&!safeLink(s.url))fail('来源 URL 必须是公开 HTTP(S) 地址，不能含凭据');if(['rss','codex'].includes(s.adapter)&&!s.url)fail('RSS / Codex 来源需要 url');if('urls'in s){list(s.urls,'urls');if(s.urls.some(u=>!safeLink(u)))fail('urls 中存在无效地址');}if(s.adapter==='jsonld'&&!s.urls?.length)fail('JSON-LD 来源需要 urls 数组');}
 return config;
}
export function filterJobs(jobs,filters){
 const terms=(filters.query||'').trim().toLocaleLowerCase().split(/\s+/).filter(Boolean);
 return jobs.filter(j=>{const hay=[j.title,j.company,j.location,...(j.tags||[]),j.description].join(' ').toLocaleLowerCase();return terms.every(t=>hay.includes(t))&&(!filters.location||j.location===filters.location)&&(!filters.workplaces?.length||filters.workplaces.includes(j.workplace))&&(!filters.sources?.length||filters.sources.some(s=>(j.source_ids||[j.source_id]).includes(s)))&&(!filters.status||filters.status==='all'||j.status===filters.status);}).sort((a,b)=>filters.sort==='company'?a.company.localeCompare(b.company,'zh-CN'):(Date.parse(filters.sort==='published'?b.published_at:b.first_seen_at)||0)-(Date.parse(filters.sort==='published'?a.published_at:a.first_seen_at)||0)||a.id.localeCompare(b.id));
}
